---
$ nage user add --help
[stdout]
Add a user who is not an admin

Usage: nage user add [OPTIONS] --by <ADMIN> --username <NAME> --display-name <NAME>

Options:
      --data-dir <DIR>       The data folder that holds nage.sqlite, which must exist and be set up [env: NAGE_DATA_DIR] [default: ./data]
      --by <ADMIN>           The username of the admin who adds the user
      --username <NAME>      The new user's username
      --display-name <NAME>  The new user's display name
      --password-stdin       Read the password once from standard input instead of asking for it twice at the terminal
  -h, --help                 Print help
[stderr]
[exit] 0
